  offerDialogue:
    name: Silas
    sentences:
    - When that vehicle crosses, pay attention to how the bridge handles its weight.
    - Think about how the whole structure can work together to carry it.
    - Study the span carefully and decide how you want to approach it.
    - If you're ready, I'll give you the contract.
